### D-322
date: 2026-10-03
milestone: M28
scope: ledger
title: Plan deletes buckets and plans, a bill outside the month says so, the comparison covers fixed expenses, and went out is fixed plus the rest
question: What did real use of Plan (delete, months, compare, Home) need?
answer: Remove this bucket hands its share right (withoutAllocation) and deletes a bucket no plan uses; the default plan can be deleted; set_plan has remove_buckets. fixedPlanParts is asked about the planned month and lists bills not running in it (outsideMonth) with a reason on the row. planAgainstActual compares buckets (moved categories by net moved) and each fixed expense to its matched charges, or says why nothing. Home shows Fixed expenses + Everything else = went out; month_summary too.
