### D-323
date: 2026-10-03
milestone: M28
scope: ledger
title: Wealth is four places, and a goal's monthly amount is the Plan bucket that points at it
question: What shape does Wealth take, and where does a goal's monthly amount live?
answer: Rail Overview/Goals/Debts/Funds; net worth is four figures on Overview, Money map reachable by a link, old paths forward. A goal's monthly amount IS the Plan bucket pointing at it, edited from Goals through changedTo and updateSplitPlan (no new write; set_plan reaches it). Projection is plain addition to the target, no interest counted; needs-to-be-on-time uses the same month count. goal_projection reads it.
