question: How do Overview, Debts and Funds take the approved Wealth design?
answer: account gains opening_balance (money) and opening_date; opening plus transactions on or after the date must equal the latest committed VERIFIED statement closing balance (ADDS_UP / OFF / UNCHECKED with reason); Overview Accounts table edits it, tool set_opening_balances (dry-run). Money map places and holdings are a section of Overview (MoneyMap embedded). Debts mirrors Goals: Left, Paid each month (standing order or observed), Extra = the Plan bucket pointing at the debt (editGoalMonthly takes a kind), In N months, paid-off month; plain addition because a debt has no rate (D-083); queue and split purchases in a menu; read tool debt_projection. Funds: Deposits chip column linking to the deposit check route, Fee impact a collapsed section (/wealth/fees opens it), Readers a menu entry, no tab strip.
