answer: Pause = saving_goal.paused_until (pause_goals, 1-12 months, 0 resumes; projection skips, Goals gives the amount back, Plan bucket untouched). Set-aside older than 90 days (after FIFO withdrawals) is asked on Goals via saving_deposit.confirmed_on (settle_set_aside: still there / gone writes a withdrawal). fund_account.agreed_return shown apart from assumed returns in Fee impact; CONTRACTUAL holding rate shown beside goal projection. Moved vs planned over 3 full months. suggest_goal_amounts: cushion first, then nearest date, pool includes the remainder bucket, written via setGoalMonthly. Points at creates goal/debt/category/fund/account in one write. Goal drawer is a ListDetail overlay.
