### D-329
date: 2026-10-03
milestone: M28
scope: ledger
title: Moved against planned counts only the months a goal was taking money: a paused goal is not compared, and the window starts with the goal's first deposit
question: Goals' 3-month 'vs plan' figure (moved minus three times the monthly amount) read as a large negative for a goal made recently or paused now. What should it compare?
answer: versusPlan (src/domain/goalRhythm.ts), on GoalRow.versusPlan, read by the Goals screen and goal_projection. Paused: not compared ('paused, not compared'), because a pause stores only its end month. Otherwise the window (three full months before this one) starts at the month of the goal's earliest deposit of any kind, since a goal has no date of its own; planned = monthly x those months. No deposit, or a first one this month: 'nothing to compare yet'. A shorter window says how many months. Amends D-326's S2. Rejected: a creation date column (schema for one figure); hiding the figure whenever nothing moved.
