answer: Onboarding (screens, step machine, onboardingRepository, onboarding_status, advance_onboarding, add_institutions) is gone. domain/guide.ts is the engine's reader; a pack declares steps on PackDescription.guide (route, place, words, test, needs) — the ledger's six in data/packs/ledger/guide.ts, checks in guideRepository.ts. The dialog (ui/guide/Guide.tsx) points at a data-guide place with an outline and no scrim, never writes; a step ticks when the document shows it done and names what it found. Put away, the step is stored in the ledger setting 'guide'; Home's Getting started line, Help › Guide me (shell) and the palette resume it. An empty document is offered it once. ui/guide/places.test.ts fails when a step names a place no screen has. Conversation: guide_status (read only); import_statement takes new_account and makes the account via resolveAccountForImport. Parity ledger ratchet 79→81 (skipAll was a by-name phantom; createInstitution now screen-only; saveGuideProgress replaces removeRecordFor).
