### D-367
date: 2026-10-05
milestone: M31
scope: ledger
title: Every question the app has waits in one list at the top of Home and is answered there where the answer is a click or two; the notice bar is one count pointing at it; a month with no pay and a card charge with no statement get an answer of their own
question: Where does an import's leftover question get asked and answered, and what of the two questions that could only be closed by a document that may never exist?
answer: attention() ranks ten kinds (totals first: settlement, transfer, card with no statement, missing statement for the newest month; then categories, payments, bills, payslip, fund, holding); waitingItems in homeRepository.ts is the one read for Home's 'Waiting for an answer' (ui/home/WaitingList.tsx, one switch) and the single notice bar ('n answers wait on Home', hidden on Home). A one-or-two-click answer is given in the row through the screen's own row component; categories, a fund balance, a holding's new figure open their screen. New writes: setNoPayMonths (setting paychecks.no_pay_months; Paychecks table and paychecks tool skip the month) and countCardCharges (setting settlements.counted_charges, by bank row; unmatchedSettlements skips them); tools set_no_pay_months and count_card_charges. Bills come from billCandidates (Plan's reading), tracked without a plan. No Undo receipts.
