### D-388
date: 2026-10-05
milestone: M36
scope: ledger
title: Shorter forms: a goal asks no kind and no kind of goal goes first in a split; a holding asks name, kind and a fee and works out the rest; a deduction type's flags and Pays into are guesses to confirm; Show archived is in each screen's menu
question: Which questions can the goal, holding and deduction-type forms stop asking, and how does a goal become the emergency one once 'What it is for' goes?
answer: No goal is the emergency one: the goal form drops 'What it is for' and Suggest a split fills goals by nearest date (no kind first); the kind column stays, the form makes EARMARKED, create_saving_goals takes kind as optional. The holding form asks name, kind, an optional fee (and Term ends for a deposit): Reachable = reachableOf(kind, term end), kept on an edit unless kind or term changed; provenance = provenanceOf(readings) on save (none keeps what it was made as); Last checked and expected return are not asked. Deduction types show the two flags as words in one 'Counts as' column with Change; a kind change carries flags still at the old kind's guess (kindChange); Pays into offers its one likely fund or payroll loan to link with a click (guessDestination). Show archived/closed is in a PageMenu on Net worth, Accounts, Categories, Goals. Add a holding works on an account with holdings that has no place yet (placeIdFor makes the place with its cash). Place kind's Provident/Study fund wait for U12.
