question: Should Open… through the file picker replace unsaved work without asking?
answer: No. Every Open… (title bar while a document is open, Ctrl+O, palette, shell File menu) calls requestOpenFile, which asks before the picker when there is unsaved work. pendingNew became pendingReplace: 'new' | 'pick', one notice for both; opening any document clears it. The empty window's Open… opens at once.
