answer: Motions (1)-(3) of D-421 are on in every build, the demo and check:tours (motionOn() = not reduced motion and WAAPI); (4) navigating and closing stays behind the dev-server switch (fadesOn) until U3. Figures still count: D-167 stands, useAnimatedNumber untouched. Wired into the format sheet's rows and columns, its panels and an entry's (Reveal grow), an entry's claims, the board's cards (Flip replaces D-306's fc-land slide), the ledger's transactions tbody and merchant queue, and the learning offer. Every layout-moving animation carries id LAYOUT_MOTION (src/ui/motion/settle.ts); the tour runner awaits layoutSettled(doc) before finding/measuring an anchor (and re-finds it if motion ran) and before an outline; inert elements and ghost copies (stripped of data-tour/id/data-row) are never anchors. Rejected: a fixed delay; finishing animations at fast-forward; ListDetail's side pane now (a route remount, U3's).
