### S-071
found_by: M45 U1
kind: duplicated
area: ui
title: Click-outside and Escape dismissal written six times
location: src/ui/formats/EntryValue.tsx:684 useDismiss (also used by EntryView.tsx:693); src/ui/savings/WherePicker.tsx:72; src/ui/categories/AppearancePicker.tsx:64; src/ui/categories/ParentPicker.tsx:52; src/ui/components/CategoryPicker.tsx:100; src/ui/plan/PointsAt.tsx:92
evidence: AST graph found six. M45 U3 did not merge: they differ in behaviour, not only in style. Escape: EntryValue (window keydown) and PointsAt close on it; WherePicker listens in the capture phase and stops propagation, so Escape closes the picker and not the editor behind it; AppearancePicker, ParentPicker and CategoryPicker do not handle Escape at all (the last two have their own keyboard handling in their input). Outside: contains(target) in five, composedPath in CategoryPicker (a target swapped out of the page is not outside, M31 U6). Event: mousedown in five, pointerdown in PointsAt; window in EntryValue, document elsewhere. One hook means choosing each of these for all six, and Escape reaching the editor behind a picker is a visible change.
action: maintainer
into: useDismiss in a new src/ui/components/useDismiss.ts, using composedPath and handling Escape everywhere.
risk: Category, parent and appearance pickers, the savings where picker, entry pick menus, the Plan points-at popover. Escape now closing the three pickers is a small visible change.
state: done
outcome: M45 F1: useDismiss in src/ui/components/useDismiss.ts serves all six (EntryValue's PickMenu, EntryView's show-as menu, WherePicker, AppearancePicker, ParentPicker, CategoryPicker, PointsAt). Outside is composedPath, on pointerdown, on document. Escape from outside the popover is caught in the capture phase on document and stopped; from inside, the popover's own handlers go first and the returned onKeyDown closes it at its edge and stops it. Verified in the browser: the three pickers now close on Escape, the fixed-expense editor behind stays, the category picker's create form still goes back to the list and the parent picker's search still hands focus back.

