body: "M53 F6 is built on claude/m53-f6-date-words-0b55e6 at 310fbfc (worktree F:/projects/emerald/.claude/worktrees/m53-f6-date-words-0b55e6). No migration. Land it with land_units inbox:[this id].\n\n```json\n{\"unit\": \"M53 F6\", \"files\": \"src/domain/format/clock.ts\\nsrc/domain/format/ddl.ts\\nsrc/domain/format/aggregate.ts\\nsrc/domain/format/document.ts\\nsrc/data/repositories/unitRepository.ts\\nsrc/data/repositories/formatFilterRepository.ts\\nsrc/data/repositories/formatRollupRepository.ts\\nsrc/data/repositories/formatValuesRepository.ts\\nsrc/data/repositories/formatDocumentRepository.ts\\nsrc/ui/formats/FilterBand.tsx\\nsrc/ui/screens/Calendar.tsx\\nsrc/ui/nav.ts\\nsrc/App.tsx\\nsrc/plugin/tools/formats.ts\\nsrc/parity.test.ts\\nsrc/ui/formats/dateWords.test.ts\\ndocs/09-decision-log.md\\ndocs/plugin.md\\ndocs/04-data-model.md\\ndocs/engine.md\", \"commit\": \"310fbfc\", \"branch\": \"claude/m53-f6-date-words-0b55e6\", \"decisions\": [{\"ref\": \"D-528\", \"title\": \"A date's filter takes yesterday, tomorrow, last N days/weeks and this/last/next week/month/year beside D-472's words; a date column's filter menu offers them above its ticks, written as a conversation types them, so a saved view stays current; the week start is the document's, Monday when unset; amends D-472\", \"question\": \"How does a screen filter a date by words around today, and which day does a week start on?\", \"answer\": \"clock.ts parses yesterday, tomorrow, last N days|weeks (today and the N-1 days before it; last 0 days is not a window), and this|last|next week|month|year on the local calendar; within N is unchanged. A typed date column's filter menu (FilterBand via columnValues.words) lists 18 words above its ticks with their row counts, as radios (a window is asked alone); typed words in the find box are written as words; format_rows values lists them under Around today. The week start is week_start in document_setting (no migration), week_starts_on in a text document's settings.md, set in Settings > Calendar (any of seven days) and by record_units week_starts_on; filterQuery, runRollup and the menu's counts read it. A claim still may not read the clock.\"}], \"review_entries\": [{\"do\": \"On a document with a dated format, open the date column's filter menu, choose this week, save the view, then change Settings > Calendar to Sunday\", \"should\": \"The menu lists the words above the dates with counts that match the rows; the band says due is this week; the saved view's address keeps this week; after Sunday the Calendar line and the view show the Sunday-to-Saturday week\"}], \"report\": \"M53 F6 built at 310fbfc. Words: yesterday, tomorrow, last N days/weeks, this/last/next week/month/year (clock.ts), read by filterQuery, rollup where (runRollup passes the document's week start) and the menu. Menu: 18 words above a date's ticks with counts, radios, typed words entered as words. Week start: document_setting week_start, settings.md week_starts_on, Settings > Calendar, record_units week_starts_on; Monday unset. No migration. Engine tool-text budget raised 56.5k -> 57k with a note. ask-cold could not run (claude -p not logged in in this session). Tours skipped: none drives the column menu or Settings.\"}\n```"
