### M22 U3 #2
question: Should a link read back as the uuid it is stored as? D-240 found a link printing as a uuid in both views, so reading what a decision supersedes took a second call. ANSWERED by D-241: a link reads back as the target's first text column. The rule already existed in four copies and was applied only where a person chooses a link, not where one is read. It is now labelColumn in declaration.ts, with one copy and four call sites.
opened_by: D-240
