### Monetization
question: How does Emerald earn anything without a backend, accounts or a hosted model? Ranked by fit: (1) free personal use, paid commercial/team licence; (2) a paid signed, notarised build with auto-update, since today it ships unsigned; (3) team sync — where the money usually is, and where agent trackers went for merge — but it contradicts D-115, so last; (4) supporter / pay-what-you-want. Rejected: per-call pricing or a hosted model — they reintroduce the backend and data custody that were designed out.
