breaks: The driver merged M51 F6 without these edits on 2026-10-22, at the maintainer's choice (option B), because changing what the plugin ships cuts its version (0.1.6+1) and the release is the maintainer's. Until the cut, installed plugins still teach the old run-the-whole-suite habit.
not_tried: Also the maintainer's to decide: an EMERALD_DENYLIST repository secret, without which CI skips src/privacy.test.ts.
