### Open the app with no document. Read the front door, then New document — you should land on `#/formats` with the engine's own rail: Formats, Connections and Settings. Then `#/settings` → Packs, press Show it and watch the whole ledger come back; press Hide it and watch it go. Then, with it hidden, paste `#/wealth/funds` and `#/paychecks/deductions` into the address bar.
