means: A column whose value is worked out rather than typed: a claim's expression with no `=` (a derived column, compiled into one SQL view per format, fmt_<name>__derived, D-334), or a total over the rows that link here. A value, read-only, never failing, blank where a row cannot answer. Listed under Computed, apart from the claims.
not: A claim, which is a verdict rather than a value.
