means: The view kind: one row per line, with a tick, the title and the line's columns, grouped by one column. Every format has one, at #/formats/<name>/list, and it sits beside Table and Board in the format's one tab strip. The list beside an open entry is the same list, narrow.
not: Not the entry's list (EntryList) as a separate thing — since M53 U4 it is this list in its narrow width. Not a `links` column (several rows of another format), nor an `enums` column's members.
