means: What debt repayment costs a month — excluding every debt already accounted for elsewhere: payroll-deducted, charged to a card as installments, or recorded as a bill too. One door to it in the code.
not: A bill. The glossary called this 'Monthly obligation', the phrase D-375 retired as a screen word for a bill, so the debt figure says debt.
