brief: Asked 2026-10-18: whether the frame can stay fixed, at the end of the chat or in a side panel. MCP Apps has no side panel and no pinning; it names inline, fullscreen and pip (a small window that floats while the conversation scrolls), each the host's to offer. A trial, so pip can be seen where a host has it: the frame declares all three, shows Float / Full screen / Back in the chat for the modes the host offers, and says which the host named, on screen. Whether to keep it, and where it belongs, is the maintainer's after seeing it.
