title: Start a new period: a saved shape that makes linked rows from a few inputs
state: planned
brief: Parked 2026-10-14 until M49 (time) is built, since a new period is mostly dates. From a planner session in a second project: every semester repeats one shape — a semester row, its course rows, their units, assignments and exams — and setting one up takes an hour by hand. A saved template that, given a few inputs (the period's start, which courses), makes the linked rows in one dry run. Ask first whether it is a pack's job (M32), a read from a .json (M48 U2), or its own thing; it must not become a program a model writes (D-132).
files: src/data/packs/packs.ts, src/plugin/tools/intake.ts

