landed: 2026-09-26
decision: D-279
state: built
brief: D-265, D-276: no data is carried. Group: saving_goal, saving_deposit, debt, debt_payment, purchase_plan (links security and holding, so after U4). Repositories move onto the pack's tables; on open the old tables are dropped with whatever they hold, nothing copied. source_kind/auto_track_kind with their _ref become several links with at most one set (D-252, D-259). Amortisation and projections stay pack code.

### M25 U6
milestone: M25
scope: engine
title: funds move, and the ledger gets its first identity
landed: 2026-09-26
decision: D-280
state: built
brief: D-265, D-276: no data is carried. Group: fund_account, fund_balance_snapshot, fund_deposit. Repositories move onto the pack's tables; on open the old tables are dropped with whatever they hold, nothing copied. salary_month is a month and the fee_*_bp columns ratios. The parts of a snapshot against its total is an identity — the first the ledger declares — and the funds screen's own check should become that identity's verdict rather than code beside it. Fees over time stay pack code. Proof: read a real pension report (the real-documents folder) into a fresh document, the identity agreeing with the report's own total.

### M25 U7
milestone: M25
scope: engine
title: paychecks, splitting and fixed expenses move
landed: 2026-09-26
decision: D-281
state: built
brief: D-265, D-276: no data is carried. Last because deduction_type links saving goals, debts and fund accounts (at most one set). Group: deduction_type (seeded in U1 — seeded fresh once its old table is dropped), paycheck, paycheck_line, split_plan, split_bucket, allocation (mode decides which amount is required; target is several links with at most one set), fixed_expense. Repositories move onto the pack's tables; on open the old tables are dropped with whatever they hold, nothing copied. Net = gross minus the lines that reduce it is a filtered aggregate plus an identity (D-260). The splitter and fixed-expense detection stay pack code. Proof: read a real payslip into a fresh document, net agreeing.

### M25 U8
milestone: M25
scope: engine
title: the rest, the finish line, and the pack back at the front door
landed: 2026-09-28
decision: D-282
state: built
brief: D-265, D-276. What is left: document_template (PDF readings by position), app_setting (name where a pack's settings go), column_role, onboarding state, anything U1's shrinking list still names — moved, old tables dropped, nothing copied. Then the old ledger tables stop being made at all: a migration drops any that remain and new documents never get them, and convert.ts (U2's and U3's copying) is deleted with them. The finish-line test: a document holds no table that is neither fmt_ nor the engine's own, and U1's list of old tables is empty. Undo M20 U0's staging (D-228): the ledger is at the front door again; answer open questions 'M20 U0 #1' and 'M20 U0 #2' while there. Then M25 is the maintainer's to close.

