### M28 F10
milestone: M28
scope: ledger
title: Wealth matches its mockup, and Plan's bucket removal sits where the bucket is
landed: 2026-10-03
decision: D-328
state: built
brief: Faults from the trial of M28 U8 (6bcfdb8, 9317491, f1ec080, aff0cd6; D-323..D-326), 2026-10-03: poorly executed; the result does not look like the HTML mockup that was shown; the overview is not even close to the mockup. The approved mockup docs/mockups/m28-u8/wealth.html IS the spec (https://claude.ai/artifact/KkMo1zccAkE7j2sbtXNXsB). U8 was built on Sonnet across four slices, each verified only on an empty scratch document; nobody ever compared the build with the mockup. (1) Overview is not scaled with the screen (see F2; check 1440x900, 1920x1080 and narrow). (2) Overview, Goals, Debts and Funds must match the mockup: port its structure, labels, order and CSS from the mockup's source rather than reinterpreting it, then diff get_page_text/read_page of the mockup against each built page with data, and fix or list every difference. Decided 2026-10-03: no screenshot comparison, it is token-heavy; widths and colours are checked with javascript_tool, at most one or two small screenshots if something is really visual. (3) Too many text explanations again — cut the explanatory prose to what the mockup has; actions say plainly what they do (F3). (4) Light mode: Goals' horizon picker shows the selected option dark with its text invisible. (5) The Emergency fund's goal drawer overlay has a transparent background; it needs a solid surface and a scrim. (6) Suggest a split does not belong on the Goals screen — move Suggest a split to Plan (Goals may link to it). (7) Plan: the remove-bucket confirm (F8) appears far from the bucket; it must appear at the bucket. (8) The cushion counts only fixed expenses; confirmed: split buckets can be ticked (e.g. groceries) to count among the months of expenses too — a per-bucket include. (9) The whole flow is kind of broken — walk the Wealth flow end to end on a synthetic document (accounts, goals with bank and set-aside deposits, a debt, a fund, a plan): create a goal from Points-at, file a deposit, see it on the goal, set the cushion, pause, suggest; fix every break and list them. Built on Opus (decided 2026-10-03).
