### M30 U2
milestone: M30
scope: ledger
title: A row can name a holding and a quantity
landed: 2026-10-04
decision: D-355
state: built
brief: A transaction (and a staged row) may name a holding and a quantity: such a row is cash turning into a holding inside one account, so it counts in neither came in nor went out (movedRepository, statistics) and adds nothing to a month's spending. A holding's quantity is the sum of its rows' quantities. Quantities are decimals, not money (money stays minor units + currency). Done-test: a buy row adds zero to the month summary, and the holding's quantity equals the sum of its rows. Start from the transaction format/table, src/data/repositories/movedRepository.ts, statisticsRepository.ts.
