scope: engine
title: Save as pack
state: planned
brief: From the formats list, choose some of a document's formats and save them as a pack: their declarations, the views they have, and optionally up to a handful of example rows. The links between chosen formats come along; a link to a format not chosen is named before saving - either add that format or record it under needs (the ledger case: a beauty-products format linking into a transaction). Read-only on the document, so parity (D-227) wants a tool too: export_pack returns the file's text for a list of format names. Done-test: saving the five development formats from docs/memory.emd produces the file U1's test expects; saving one format whose link points outside the selection says so and offers both answers.
