### M34 U3
milestone: M34
scope: engine
title: What is wrong, said without being asked
landed: 2026-10-06
decision: D-396
state: built
brief: The pitch fired in the trial only when the model was asked to look. Make the engine say it. After any read, and on demand (a tool and a band on the format's page), report what the engine can know mechanically: a link column filled on most rows and empty on some (the assignment with no course while 1-7 have one), rows identical in every column (the duplicate workout), identities failed or unchecked, and lines refused on read. And account for every line of a file read: read, refused, or skipped as empty, the tally summing to the file's lines - so a model reading through the engine cannot drop rows quietly, as the trial's did. What the engine cannot know (a project Done whose tasks are Not started) is not guessed: it needs a rule someone declared, which is a later question, written as an open_question. Done-test: a synthetic fixture with one empty link among filled ones, one duplicate row and one failed identity reports all three after reading, unasked; the tally of a read equals the file's line count.
