### M34 U7
milestone: M34
scope: engine
title: A folder of Markdown notes is a table
landed: 2026-10-06
decision: D-400
state: built
brief: "Readers are generic by kind of file and never by product (2026-10-05: no Notion reader, no Obsidian reader - a Markdown reader). Nothing reads Markdown notes today, so a folder of them - a vault, a wiki, an export - ends in hand-typing. Read a folder of .md files onto a format: each note one row; YAML frontmatter keys to columns by the same mapping a spreadsheet's headers get (guessed, shown, corrected); the body to a text column; and a link in a link column taken from either common form - [[name]] and [text](path.md) - filled by the exact unique name of its row (D-261), the target named by its title or its file name, refused otherwise. Standard Markdown links are what make this cover exports whose relations live in per-page links (a real Notion export keeps them only there), with nothing specific to any product. D-210 found a real recipe vault is the engine built by hand: its ingredient notes are the fixture's shape. Done-test: a synthetic folder of ingredient and recipe notes (fixtures/synthetic) reads in one call onto two formats with links filled, one note linking by [[name]] and one by [text](file.md); a note whose frontmatter names a missing ingredient is refused and named; no code path names a product.\n\nDriver, 2026-10-06, from M34 U2 (D-395): on the screen's Read files, every new file still needs 'Make a reader' before it reads - three extra clicks for three files. The make-it-in-place rule says the guessed mapping is shown in place and accepted with the read; fold that in here for .md and the spreadsheet kinds alike if it is small. Also the reader editor labels a link key 'recipe — pick one below', which reads oddly."
files: src/domain/format/notes.ts (+test), src/domain/format/reading.ts (separators, rowNames, link guess, links read), src/data/repositories/formatJoinRepository.ts, src/plugin/tools/intake.ts (folders), src/plugin/tools/intakeNotes.test.ts, src/plugin/instructions.ts, src/ui/formats/noteFiles.ts (+test), src/ui/screens/ReadFiles.tsx (guess in place), src/ui/formats/IntakePanel.tsx, fixtures/synthetic/notes/, docs/mapping-templates.md, docs/plugin.md, docs/09-decision-log.md
