landed: 2026-10-19
decision: D-507
state: built
brief: D-506 and D-507 were both found by a session outside this repo reading the MCP server cold. scripts/ask-cold.mjs does that on purpose: in a fresh empty temp folder (no CLAUDE.md, skills or memory reach it) it runs headless `claude -p --strict-mcp-config --mcp-config` naming only `node <repo>/dist-plugin/server.mjs`, once --engine-only and once full, asking a fixed list of questions (kept in the script so it grows), each in its own fresh run. Answers go to a file outside the repo. For each answer it prints red flags matched mechanically (money first, finance, built for, main strength is checking, add up, numbers as the reason, not designed for, against notes for lacking figures); the session running it judges the rest against D-506/D-507 (any kind of thing; ask for rows instead of re-reading files; typed fields and links; every session sees the same rows; checks one benefit; a Markdown folder read in place; packs optional). docs/plugin.md says how to run it; the closing pass (conventions.md and .claude/skills/closing-pass) runs it for a change to instructions.ts or a tool description. A maintainer/session tool only: never in CI, never imported by src/, the app and server stay offline (D-124).
