report: M53 F1 built at daf2c99. listOf no longer guesses done (D-519's first-enum-last-member / first-boolean fallback is gone, and ListShape.done lost `chosen`); a list with no `done <members>` is plain lines everywhere it draws — List tab, the narrow list beside an entry, a dashboard list block, show_format and formats' List: line ('with no tick'). The list header's tick control replaces 'Ticked when': it says 'No ticks' or 'Ticking marks state done' and opens 'Tick to mark…' (each enum member and each yes/no, then 'No ticks', which clears done off its column). New tickWords(done, before) in view.ts names what the circle sets: 'Mark done' / 'Undo: back to open' (from the member the row held when known, else tickValue's fallback), used by the list and the dashboard's list block. A tick stays in place, struck, for 4 s (SINK_MS was 1100) with an 'Undo' button that writes back the held member. views.md declares done for unit (built), milestone (closed), open_question (answered), review_entry (accepted), inbox (applied); past.ts lists them. memory.emd: the same set by arrange_views, plus finding state done (finding is not a pack format). Tests: listView.test (no tick without done, incl. boolean; finding ticks state not kind; undo restores the held member; header/circle words; arrange_views says 'with no tick' then 'ticked when'); related suite 2239 green, typecheck green. Browser (dev server, a copy of memory.emd opened in memory): finding list header 'Ticking marks state done', circles 'Mark done'; decision list and its entry's narrow list have no ticks; set 'state superseded' from the header in place, ticked a row, Undo put it back to live; No ticks cleared it. Not done: no browser check of a dashboard list block (same shape, no own logic).

### M53 F2
milestone: M53
